              "message": "B1 is not independently buildable: T001 changes the pair/cache-key constructors, but the affected check/results callers remain in T003/B2, while cache codecs and CLI composition/driver callers are not owned by any task. Migrate all affected call sites in the same batch/order as the domain change, or declare concrete ownership before B1.",
